OL,3,GNEWSAMayor sets out plan to scrap his
OL,4,Aown role in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors will be asked to consider
OL,7,Fplans to abolish Leicester's elected
OL,8,Fmayor in May 2027.
OL,10,FThe post was due to be scrapped in 2028
OL,11,Fin a major shake-up of council
OL,12,Fboundaries.
OL,14,FHowever, this week, the government
OL,15,Fpaused the process, known as local
OL,16,Fgovernment reorganisation (LGR), and
OL,17,Fsaid councils should proceed with city
OL,18,Fcouncil and mayoral elections in
OL,19,FLeicester.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
