OL,3,GNEWSAMayor sets out plan to scrap his
OL,4,Aown role in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrent city mayor Sir Peter Soulsby
OL,7,Ftold the BBC he felt it was pointless
OL,8,Ffor voters to be asked to elect a mayor
OL,9,Fwho was only likely to serve "one or
OL,10,Ftwo years at most" before the city
OL,11,Fcouncil is dissolved.
